Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalSeadramon was\Nblasting it into rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We escaped into the ocean\Non Pseudomon's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, we thought we got away.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Silence of the Ocean Bottom! Whamon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shunmoku no Kaitei, Hoeyemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Divermon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just came up for a little air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Divermon, if it wasn't\Nfor their striking Fish Attack,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.29,0:02:40.26,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Hangyomon{{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.29,0:02:40.26,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.29,0:02:40.26,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.29,0:02:40.26,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Aquatic Beast Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.29,0:02:40.26,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.29,0:02:40.26,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Strike Fishing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd be useless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever those kids try\Nto hide, I'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rule this ocean with an\Niron hand, an iron tail,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and an iron everything for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch them even with\NWhamon on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just sit there treading water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, go find those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving us, Whamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, seriously, don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want it to get around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, we still have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we going to be able\Nto defeat the Dark Masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how they took over the\Ndigital world in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember, Whamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I remember Whamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big fella, snappy dresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know all the details, but soon\Nafter the digital world began to warp,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Seadramon began\Nto take over the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn! Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, sorry, Whamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, don't get upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done it before, haven't we? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find a safe place for you\Noutside of Meadow Sidramon's reach,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if I have to swim to\Nthe far corners of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, did I mention\NI charge by the mile?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't land on their feet,\Nbut we still need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gatoman's wish for\Nsome fresh flying fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm a kitty, a digi-kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Gatomon, but the\Nrest of us have to eat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand aside and watch how a pro does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys and Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dinner's served.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop playing, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that song is just too depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It always gives me the blues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can't stop thinking\Nabout the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're different from any\NDigimon we've ever faced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've analyzed the situation, and I\Nbelieve we can defeat them with WarGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a Dramon Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon Destroyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try speaking English.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, the weapons on\NWarGreymon's arms are the key.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:42.19,Sign,,0,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}WarGreymon{{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:42.19,Sign,,320,0,145,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:42.19,Sign,,320,0,180,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:42.19,Sign,,320,0,215,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Dragon Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:42.19,Sign,,320,0,285,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:42.19,Sign,,320,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Gaia Force
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're especially effective\Nagainst Draymon-type Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hence the phrase Deramon Destroyer.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.11,0:05:41.19,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}D{\1a&HFF&\bord0\shad0}ramon Killer
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.19,0:05:41.31,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}Dra{\1a&HFF&\bord0\shad0}mon Killer
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.31,0:05:41.36,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}Dramo{\1a&HFF&\bord0\shad0}n Killer
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.36,0:05:41.44,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}Dramon{\1a&HFF&\bord0\shad0} Killer
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.44,0:05:41.52,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}Dramon Ki{\1a&HFF&\bord0\shad0}ller
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.52,0:05:41.61,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}Dramon Kill{\1a&HFF&\bord0\shad0}er
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.61,0:05:42.19,Sign,,0,300,155,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\b1}Dramon Killer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With these devices, we might be\Nable to defeat the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, you're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon Destroyer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, you're gonna\Neat those Deramon alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you just learn\Nanything new in school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We learned diver monitor in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, we got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught a whopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divermon are headed this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not Divermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but Divermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what are Divermon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, those are Metal Seedramon's henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the fish have seen\Nthem about 200 miles behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll find us too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, everyone get inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't mind the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had fish for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red leader to blue leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Areas 13 through 18 are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold leader to blue leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Areas 23 and 24 are clear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Phil, Sid, how many\Ntimes do I have to tell you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are just three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you smell something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a scent of\NDigidestined in the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that or there's a bad\Npatch of seaweed around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my moment to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does my hair look all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Digidestined fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can swim, but you can't hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was taking catnap and it woke me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm too brainless to understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I'll tell you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cool screensaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a screensaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I connected to Waymon's\Nhard drive and rerouted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all his sensory\Ninformation to my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rerouted?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you're seeing on the screen is exactly\Nwhat Whamon is looking at right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool, like a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, I've always wanted\Nto go on a submarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's been out\Nto sea a little too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hate square dances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're starting to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, stop. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you know, my ears\Nhurt a little too. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I dove a little too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix the pressure now. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's one way\Nto equalize the gas pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, you're excused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that sound? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Divermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they've passed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not out of danger yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to be quiet a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Whamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendly, now this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found Whamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in Area 51 on the ocean floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, keep an eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the barge and he\Ncan tell MetalSeadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found Whamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now, old\Nmaster of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stacking face! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Divermon are attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did all those bubbles come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Key, I couldn't see where I was aiming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're squeezing me too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you're squeezing me too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I guess we're all a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stuck in here and can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the audio\Nsensors, there are three more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Whamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're gaining on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Whamon, let's go\Nup to the surface and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, hopefully it'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what the captain\Nof the Titanic said!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Striking fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if it doesn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still think we should turn and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you know what you're doing, Whamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon must be crazy trying to\Nescape into such a narrow space.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay with him, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and the big whale, pull over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got your tracks. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't take the water pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Waymon's plan all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon has built to handle pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike some of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, forgive me for not being a whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had this\Nkind of hidden attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great, but what\Nare we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't stay at the\Nbottom of the ocean forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, come over here for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did it, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whistle was sort of like sonar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used the reverberations of\Nthe sound to find a tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's one up ahead\Nthat should lead us to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Whamon? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone was whistling in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a tunnel up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should lead us to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools think I don't\Nknow where they're headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're easier to figure out\Nthan a two-piece jigsaw puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy playing submarine while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-ha! A tunnel? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, we're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to get changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can those fish heads be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's MetalSeadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun's so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smell that, fresh air! I feel\NI've been underwater so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might never take a bath again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind telling me what's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's MetalSeadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only a matter of time\Nbefore you came up for air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're going down with the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Final way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should i sure go for it\Nwhile agumon gets their
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attention let's cross\Nover to the shore and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prepare ourselves for\Nbattle aye aye uh goldmaman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i will stay here and bring up the rear
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joe don't be such a coward agumon here i
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Universe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Art
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.61,0:16:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Universe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that, a love tap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm made of chrome\Ndigizoid, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hurt me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon, thanks for everything,\Nbut you can leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No tip?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you calling me pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just big bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Striking fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hypootorpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster friends to the boys and\Ngirls! Hey, Digimon! Hey, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The champions love this thing over her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon! Quick! Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon! Digimon! Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GIGIMON 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VOLTEN'S NUMBER!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PRISM OF POWER!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War Greymon! In trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War Greymon's at a huge\Ndisadvantage in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hammer Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of playing around with\Nyou War Greymon, say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,River of Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,River of Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for your impenetrable\Nchrome digizoid armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.90,0:19:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like it got a little rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you decide you\Nwant to rule the waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do everybody a favor and\Ntake a bubble bath instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined, please save this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon, where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening to MetalSeadramon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're floating in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where they're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Mountains Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's the real reason\Nfor all the shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's, uh, disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tag, I'm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Satoru, mine out! Puppet mine. In!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My future.
